### Get all contacts (local)
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts

### Get single contact by id (local) - replace with a real id from your DB
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts/XXXX

### Get all contacts (Render) - update with your Render URL after deploy
GET https://TU-SERVICIO.onrender.com/contacts

### Get single contact (Render)
GET https://TU-SERVICIO.onrender.com/contacts/XXXX